{"actor":"model","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-42497","model_call":43,"attempt":1,"model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input_tokens":22691,"output_tokens":226,"total_tokens":22917,"cached_tokens":21760,"reasoning_tokens":32},"output_characters":807,"decision":{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_17_458314113#2_496664201","relevance":3,"reason":"The document is specifically about Guiyu, a major informal e-waste recycling site, and directly describes primitive operations burning wires and plastics to liberate copper, cooking circuit boards, and producing smoke whose dioxin-laden ash settles over the area, with heavy-metal contamination.","learned":"Primitive informal e-waste recycling in Guiyu adds to air pollution by cooking circuit boards and burning wires/plastics for metal recovery, causing dioxin-laden smoke and ash to spread locally."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1489","reason":"This query has produced strong direct evidence about primitive recycling methods, smoke, and dioxin-laden ash in Guiyu, so continue for more grade-3 results."}}}
